        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It works as expected. 'mini.indentscope' takes into account only text indent. In your example you seem to use `options.try_as_border = true` which leads to showing indent scope of a construct's \"inner body\" instead of outer one. Presence or absence of brackets has nothing to do with.",
