            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I do understand that, but is it expected behaviour for it to show indent on empty lines?\r\n\r\nBy default, yes. Behavior of empty lines near the edge is controlled by `options.border`. To not recognize bottom blank lines try `options = { border = 'top' }`.",
